[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1133","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1183","title":"Linux SOCKS5 服务器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux 平台的 socks5 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送超长的连接请求触发溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响运行 socks5 服务的 Linux 服务器系统，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1183"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"立即升级所部署的 SOCKS5 服务器（如 dante 1.2.0a 及以上版本）至厂商最新稳定版，修改配置文件将服务监听地址限制为 127.0.0.1 内网地址，并使用 iptables 防火墙仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP 1080 端口作为临时缓解。若业务无需 SOCKS5 代理服务，建议直接停止相关进程并从系统启动项中移除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0219.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1183","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8059e8cdbda0c03add4039d02d7a1dd188f7b3c8/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c19e03a3f5c73c1254957c1cd474626aa25ecdd7/2000/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1183.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/72cbdcf5b0040806853b9597e1a625651c5a1bf9/api/2000/CVE-2000-1183.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1183.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1132","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1182","title":"WatchGuard Firebox II FTP/SMTP 服务泛洪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard Firebox II 防火墙设备 4.1 及 4.5 版本中的 FTP 和 SMTP 代理服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标设备发送大量 FTP 或 SMTP 请求，导致代理处理功能被禁用，从而使防火墙无法正常转发相关协议流量，造成服务中断。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度低，仅影响可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1182"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"建议升级到 WatchGuard Firebox 后续受支持版本（如 Firebox X 系列）或迁移至 WatchGuard Fireware 最新版本。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙配置访问控制规则，限制外部对 Firebox II 的 FTP（TCP 21）和 SMTP（TCP 25）端口的连接速率，并启用 SYN flood 防护和连接数限制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0224.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1953","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5535","https://www.watchguard.com/support/patches.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1182","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ed64b4e31209e933908eff50d33cf701402ff24/2000/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1182.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1182.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1182.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1131","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1179","title":"Netopia ISDN Router 650-ST 未授权日志信息泄露漏洞","description":"Netopia ISDN Router 650-ST 4.3.5 之前版本存在认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，直接连接至路由器的登录界面并输入特定控制字符，即可绕过登录验证，读取系统日志中的敏感信息。该漏洞源于登录认证机制对控制字符处理不当，攻击者利用简单的网络连接即可实施攻击，无需用户交互或特殊权限。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，影响机密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1179"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"立即将 Netopia ISDN Router 650-ST 固件升级至 4.3.5 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在路由器管理界面限制对登录端口的远程访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用 Telnet 等非加密管理协议作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97440068130051&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1952","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5536","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1179.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1179.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1179","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1179.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1179.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e997027818