/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1170.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1170.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1170.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-1170.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1170.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1170.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1170.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1129","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1168","title":"IBM HTTP Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM HTTP Server 1.3.6（基于 Apache）存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃或可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 IBM HTTP Server 1.3.6 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至最新版本或限制请求长度以缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1168"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18Z","remediation":"升级 IBM HTTP Server 到 1.3.12 或更高版本。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 简体中文版上的 IHS 1.3.6，攻击者发送 219 字符的超长 GET 请求即可触发蓝屏死机（BSOD），需管理员重启服务器恢复。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，对 URI 长度进行限制（建议不超过 1024 字节）以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97502498610979&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1988","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1168","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1168.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1168.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1168.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1128","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1167","title":"FreeBSD ppp 工具访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 4.1.1 及更早版本中的 ppp 工具未能正确遵循 \"nat deny_incoming\" 命令配置的访问限制规则，导致远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络绕过 NAT 防护策略，直接连接目标系统。该漏洞允许攻击者访问本应被拒绝的内部网络服务，造成信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断等后果。攻击者只需能够向目标发送网络数据包即可触发，利用门槛极低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1167"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 4.1.1-STABLE 或 3.5.1-STABLE 及以上版本（2000-10-30 之后）；或下载官方补丁（FreeBSD-SA-00:70）对 /usr/src/usr.sbin/ppp/nat_cmd.c 应用补丁后重新编译安装 ppp。临时缓解措施：在 PPP 网关上使用 ipfw(8) 或 ipf(8) 等真实包过滤器替代 ppp 内置的 deny_incoming 功能，按安全策略明确拒绝入站流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1655","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1974","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5584","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1167","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1167.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1167.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1167.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1127","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1166","title":"Twig webmail system 变量设置不当导致任意 PHP 代码注入漏洞","description":"Twig webmail 系统存在变量设置漏洞，当站点未配置 \"vhosts\" 变量时，系统未能正确设置该变量，导致远程攻击者可通过向 index.php3 程序传递特制的 vhosts 参数，插入任意 PHP 代码并执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，可能导致敏感信息泄露、系统数据篡改或服务中断。该漏洞影响 Twig webmail 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1166"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Twig webmail 到修复此漏洞的版本（查看 CHANGELOG 确认修复版本号），或在 index.php3 中显式初始化 \\$vhosts 变量为默认空数组后再使用，防止未初始化变量被外部参数注入。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的 Webmail 系统（如 Roundcube、SquirrelMail 等），并在迁移前于 Web 服务器层面过滤 index.php3 的 vhosts 参数输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0351.html","http://twig.screwdriver.net/file.php3?file=CHANGELOG","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1998","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1166","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1166.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1166.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1166.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1126","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1165","title":"Balabit syslog-ng 日志优先级解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Balabit syslog-ng 1.4.6、1.4.7 及 1.4.8 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 syslog-ng 服务发送特制的畸形日志消息，该消息在优先级说明符中缺少闭合的 > 符号，导致服务解析异常崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可触发，利用难度低，但仅影响系统可用性，不涉及机密性和完整性。受影响的 syslog-ng 版本需及时升级至 1.4.9 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1165"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 syslog-ng 至 1.4.9 或更高版本（如 1.4.10）。FreeBSD 用户可通过 ports collection 更新或直接安装预编译包 syslog-ng-1.4.10.tgz。如无法升级，可删除 syslog-ng 改用系统自带 syslogd，或使用 watchdog 进程（如 daemontools/supervise）监控 syslog-ng 进程，在崩溃后自动重启作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0300.html","http://www.balabit.hu/products/syslog-ng/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1981","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5576","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2000/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1165","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2000/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2000/CVE-2000-1165.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1165.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1165.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1125","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1163","title":"Ghostscript Ghostscript 本地特权提升命令执行漏洞","description":"Ghostscript 在 5.10-16 之前的版本中存在安全漏洞。该漏洞的原理在于程序在处理环境变量 LD_RUN_PATH 为空时，会默认在当前目录下搜索库文件。本地攻击者可以通过在其他用户执行 Ghostscript 的目录下放置一个伪造的特洛伊木马库文件，诱导目标用户运行程序，从而导致攻击者以该用户的权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响所有受影响版本的本地用户，攻击条件为攻击者需在目标执行路径拥有写权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1163"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17Z","remediation":"建议将 Ghostscript 升级至 5.10-16 或更高版本，以修复 LD_RUN_PATH 环境变量处理不当导致的库搜索路径问题。若无法立即升级，请确保所有用户执行 ghostscript 的目录不具备可写权限，防止攻击者在当前目录下放置恶意共享库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000343","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-041.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001123","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-074.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1991","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5564","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1163","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ea90c7fc25f5e69e4136f9e85f28f432820c894/2000/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1163.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1163.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-1163.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1124","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1161","title":"AdCycle 广告轮播管理系统密码泄露漏洞","description":"AdCycle 横幅管理系统在安装后未将 build.cgi 程序从 Web 可访问目录中移除，导致远程攻击者可直接通过 HTTP 请求访问并执行该 CGI 脚本，从而获取系统存储的明文密码或删除数据库。该漏洞影响 AdCycle 所有默认安装版本，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用，危害较大。厂商建议在安装完成后手动删除或限制对 build.cgi 的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1161"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17Z","remediation":"立即删除 web 可访问目录下的 build.cgi 程序，或将其移出 web 根目录（如移至 cgi-bin 外的私有目录）。在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中对该文件路径添加访问控制，仅允许管理员 IP 访问。AdCycle 官方已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的广告管理系统，或彻底停用该遗留系统。如必须继续使用，在 Web 服务器层面用 .htaccess 或 location 指令拒绝所有外部对 build.cgi 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0271.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1969","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1161","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2000/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1161.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1161.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1161.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1124.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1124.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1122","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1159","title":"NAI Sniffer Agent 远程权限提升漏洞","description":"NAI Sniffer Agent 存在权限提升漏洞。远程攻击者可通过嗅探初始 UDP 认证数据包获取认证凭据，然后伪造命令向 Sniffer Agent 发送恶意请求，从而在目标系统上以 Agent 权限执行任意操作。该漏洞影响 NAI Sniffer Agent 相关版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1159"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17Z","remediation":"将 NAI Sniffer Agent 部署在独立的受信管理网段，通过防火墙 ACL 限制仅允许特定管理主机访问 Agent 的 UDP 认证端口。由于该产品已停止维护，建议升级至支持加密认证的网络监控方案（如 McAfee Network Security Platform 或同类产品），避免在不可信网络中暴露未加密的 UDP 认证流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1902","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1159","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2000/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1159.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1159.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1159.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1121","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1158","title":"NAI Sniffer Agent 认证信息泄露漏洞","description":"NAI Sniffer Agent 使用 base64 编码进行身份认证，由于 base64 并非加密算法而仅是一种编码方式，用户名和密码以明文可逆形式在网络中传输。远程攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量，轻松捕获并解码包含认证信息的 base64 编码数据，从而获取明文凭据，进而未授权访问受保护的网络管理系统。该漏洞影响 NAI Sniffer Agent 相关版本，攻击者只需具备网络监听能力即可实施，无需任何身份认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1158"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 NAI Sniffer Agent 至支持强加密认证的最新版本，或迁移至 McAfee 后续替代产品。如无法升级，须在管理通信链路上启用 IPSec 或 SSH 隧道加密所有认证流量，同时在交换机端口配置 VLAN 隔离和端口安全，限制嗅探器管理流量仅在受信任的管理网段内传输，防止攻击者通过网络嗅探截获 base64 编码的明文凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0038.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1158","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2000/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1158.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1158.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/59d57936496f37081433ba541bca8c4d04c17f7f/api/2000/CVE-2000-1158.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1120","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1156","title":"StarOffice 临时目录符号链接本地文件读取漏洞","description":"tags.<value>StarOffice 5.2 办公套件在处理临时文件时，会跟随 /tmp/soffice.tmp 目录的符号链接，并将该目录权限设置为全局可读（world-readable）。未经身份认证的本地攻击者可通过创建符号链接，将 soffice.tmp 指向目标用户的敏感文件，当 StarOffice 进程尝试访问临时目录时，即可读取其他用户的数据文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 StarOffice 5.2 版本，攻击者需要具备本地系统访问权限，利用条件较低，可造成信息泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1156"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 StarOffice 6.0 或更高版本，或迁移至 OpenOffice/LibreOffice 等不受影响的办公套件。临时缓解措施包括：将环境变量 TMPDIR 设置为用户私有目录（如 $HOME/tmp）以替代默认 /tmp，确保该目录权限为 700；或通过 umask 设置默认文件权限为 077，防止临时文件被其他用户读取；同时在 /tmp 目录下定期清理并检查 soffice.tmp 符号链接，避免攻击者利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0115.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1922","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5487","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e52b937328f58a3e9a1e7e8e4c1ac9025c3099d3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1156","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8ff0f0688217475a7ba2a404f9887907cad5560/2000/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/537c626a629083369daa568372a12317339c7514/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1156.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1156.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1156.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1119","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1155","title":"BeOS RobinHood 1.1 RHDaemon 远程HTTP请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RobinHood 1.1 Web 服务器中的 RHDaemon 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，该漏洞影响 BeOS r5 pro 及更早版本。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送超长的 HTTP 请求，导致 RHDaemon 进程崩溃或资源耗尽，从而使 Web 服务不可用。攻击条件简单，只需网络可达即可触发，无需特殊权限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，仅影响服务可用性，不涉及数据机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1155"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"BeOS 已停止维护，RobinHood 1.1 不再有官方补丁。建议立即停止在生产环境中使用 BeOS 及 RobinHood 服务，迁移至受支持的操作系统与 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）。如无法立即迁移，可在网络边界防火墙或反向代理层面限制 HTTP 请求长度（如设置最大请求行不超过 4096 字节），以缓解长请求导致的拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1155","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/17e962b373a9dbef6aa7b426a0062ee15f6ee207/2000/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1155.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1155.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/59d57936496f37081433ba541bca8c4d04c17f7f/api/2000/CVE-2000-1155.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1118","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1153","title":"BeOS PostMaster 1.0 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BeOS r5 pro 及更早版本中的 PostMaster 1.0 邮件客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 URL 的邮件消息，导致 PostMaster 在处理该 URL 时发生缓冲区溢出或资源耗尽，从而使邮件客户端崩溃或无法响应。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，攻击条件仅为能够向目标发送邮件。该漏洞影响 BeOS r5 pro 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1153"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"将 BeOS r5 pro 及更早版本上的 PostMaster 1.0 升级至后续修复版本，或迁移至受支持的现代邮件服务器软件。临时缓解措施为在邮件网关或防火墙处配置规则，将入站邮件 URL 最大长度限制为 256 字节并拦截包含超长 URL 的外部邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1153","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2000/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1153.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1153.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27ef30b72e2251e5a09f792eabf726cf380537a6/api/2000/CVE-2000-1153.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1118.toml"}]